Subject: [PATCH 12/13] Aegis: run packages/core in a JS policy worker

Bundle core TypeScript into a jitless gin isolate so Privacy AI can
summarize the current tab locally, with an optional loopback Ollama
sidecar and a C++ heuristic fallback if the worker is not ready.
